      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="Tug and Glider2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="607">
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      So many great pictures. So many great memories.
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Chill. &nbsp; Scroll. &nbsp; Enjoy.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="TugLanding2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="327">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Our little Dragonfly just before touch-down.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="Ken ATOS 2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="563">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Ken launches on an ATOS rigid wing.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="Bob and Glider.jpg" WIDTH="798" HEIGHT="540">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Bob and Pilot X doing a little formation flying.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="atos3.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="491">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Advanced pilot tows aloft on his Atos rigid wing.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="airsail21a.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="560">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Competitions are enjoyed by both pilots and spectators.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/SogasBigDay.jpg" WIDTH="777" HEIGHT="508">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Starting up again at our new site
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/Bob and Don 4.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="448">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Bob and Don on the flight line with Don all set to go.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/Don on Tow 3.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="654">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      There's Don towing aloft behind the little tug that could.&nbsp; &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/Patrick at launch 2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="699">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Patrick causes distraction while the serious folks prepare to launch the
      moon rover.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/Milko on tow 2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="477">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      Milko heads for the blue room on his piano keyboard.
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/XC Planning Pic 2.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="688">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      A serious cross-country flight takes a bit of planning.&nbsp;
      <P ALIGN=Center>
      <IMG SRC="images21/Mark Launch 3.jpg" WIDTH="1000" HEIGHT="647">
      <P style="font-family:Arial" ALIGN=Center>
      &nbsp;An artsy shot of Mark launching his topless wing.
      <P ALIGN=Left>
